# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/referee/dyad-table` — Part IV: safety, consent, the frame-break law
# `lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/referee/chronicle-and-instruments` — Part V: the chronicle, the instruments, the caldera close

